{"speciesId":739,"names":{"fr":"Crabagarre","es":"Crabrawler","en":"Crabrawler","ja":"マケンカニ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il protège ses points faibles avec ses pinces en guettant le moment propice pour riposter. Il crache de l’écume lorsqu’il tombe K.O."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Protege sus puntos débiles con las pinzas y propina puñetazos en cuanto tiene ocasión. Cuando pierde, llora lágrimas espumosas."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"While guarding its weak points with its pincers, it looks for an opening and unleashes punches. When it loses, it foams at the mouth and faints."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"ハサミで 弱点を ガードしつつ 隙を うかがい パンチを 放つ。 負けたほうは 泡を ふいて ダウン。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Ses pinces se décrochent lorsqu’il s’en sert trop pour frapper, mais repoussent heureusement aussitôt. Leur chair est fine et délicieuse."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Suele perder las pinzas por usarlas demasiado, pero enseguida le vuelven a crecer. Estas tienen poca carne, pero es muy apreciada."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"It punches so much, its pincers often come off from overuse, but they grow back quickly. What little meat they contain is rich and delicious."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"なぐり過ぎで ハサミは よく もげるが すぐに 生える。 ハサミの 中味は 少ないが コクがあって うまいぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Ses robustes pinces sont aussi efficaces pour l’attaque que pour la défense. Les combats de Crabagarre ressemblent à des matchs de boxe."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Usa hábilmente sus robustas pinzas tanto para atacar como para defenderse. Las peleas entre congéneres parecen combates de boxeo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its hard pincers are well suited to both offense and defense. Fights between two Crabrawler are like boxing matches."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"硬い ハサミは 攻めも 守りも 得意。 マケンカニ 同士の 戦いは ボクシングの ようだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il grimpe parfois sur un Noadkoko qu’il a pris pour un cocotier. Il se fait alors éjecter puis piétiner par le Noadkoko courroucé."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"A veces trepa por Exeggutor al confundirlo con una palmera de verdad. Este, presa de la ira, se desembaraza de él a sacudidas y lo pisotea."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Crabrawler has been known to mistake Exeggutor for a coconut tree and climb it. The enraged Exeggutor shakes it off and stomps it."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"ヤシの木と 間違えて ナッシーに 登ることもある。 怒りを かって 振り落とされて 踏みつけられる。"}],"varieties":[{"id":739,"moves":[{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[18,"tutor",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"slam","learns":[[25,"level-up",25]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[17,"level-up",9],[18,"level-up",9],[25,"level-up",9]]},{"name":"bubble-beam","learns":[[17,"level-up",17],[18,"level-up",17],[25,"level-up",13]]},{"name":"earthquake","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"dig","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-team","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"swift","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"amnesia","learns":[[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"bubble","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"dizzy-punch","learns":[[17,"level-up",25],[18,"level-up",25]]},{"name":"crabhammer","learns":[[17,"level-up",37],[18,"level-up",37],[25,"level-up",37]]},{"name":"rest","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"rock-slide","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"substitute","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"